    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Second Census"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "After the plague, the Lord said to Moses and Eleazar son of Aaron the priest,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Take a census of the entire Israelite community by their ancestral families of those twenty years old or more who can serve in Israel’s army.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So Moses and the priest Eleazar said to them in the plains of Moab by the Jordan across from Jericho,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Take a census of those twenty years old or more, as the Lord had commanded Moses and the Israelites who came out of the land of Egypt.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Reuben was the firstborn of Israel.",
          "Reuben’s descendants:",
          "the Hanochite clan from Hanoch;",
          "the Palluite clan from Pallu;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Hezronite clan from Hezron;",
          "the Carmite clan from Carmi."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Reubenite clans,",
          "and their registered men numbered 43,730."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The son of Pallu was Eliab."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Eliab were Nemuel, Dathan, and Abiram. (It was Dathan and Abiram, chosen by the community, who fought against Moses and Aaron; they and Korah’s followers fought against the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The earth opened its mouth and swallowed them with Korah, when his followers died and the fire consumed 250 men. They serve as a warning sign."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Korah, however, did not die.)"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Simeon’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Nemuelite clan from Nemuel;",
          "the Jaminite clan from Jamin;",
          "the Jachinite clan from Jachin;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Zerahite clan from Zerah;",
          "the Shaulite clan from Shaul."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Simeonite clans, numbering 22,200 men."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Gad’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Zephonite clan from Zephon;",
          "the Haggite clan from Haggi;",
          "the Shunite clan from Shuni;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Oznite clan from Ozni;",
          "the Erite clan from Eri;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Arodite clan from Arod;",
          "the Arelite clan from Areli."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Gadite clans numbered by their registered men: 40,500."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Judah’s sons included Er and Onan, but they died in the land of Canaan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Judah’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Shelanite clan from Shelah;",
          "the Perezite clan from Perez;",
          "the Zerahite clan from Zerah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The descendants of Perez:",
          "the Hezronite clan from Hezron;",
          "the Hamulite clan from Hamul."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were Judah’s clans numbered by their registered men: 76,500."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Issachar’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Tolaite clan from Tola;",
          "the Punite clan from Puvah; ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Jashubite clan from Jashub;",
          "the Shimronite clan from Shimron."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were Issachar’s clans numbered by their registered men: 64,300."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Zebulun’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Seredite clan from Sered;",
          "the Elonite clan from Elon;",
          "the Jahleelite clan from Jahleel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Zebulunite clans numbered by their registered men: 60,500."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Joseph’s descendants by their clans from Manasseh and Ephraim:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Manasseh’s descendants:",
          "the Machirite clan from Machir.",
          "Machir fathered Gilead;",
          "the Gileadite clan from Gilead."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were Gilead’s descendants:",
          "the Iezerite clan from Iezer;",
          "the Helekite clan from Helek;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Asrielite clan from Asriel;",
          "the Shechemite clan from Shechem;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Shemidaite clan from Shemida;",
          "the Hepherite clan from Hepher;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Zelophehad son of Hepher had no sons #— #only daughters. The names of Zelophehad’s daughters were Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were Manasseh’s clans, numbered by their registered men: 52,700."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were Ephraim’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Shuthelahite clan from Shuthelah;",
          "the Becherite clan from Becher;",
          "the Tahanite clan from Tahan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          36
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were Shuthelah’s descendants:",
          "the Eranite clan from Eran."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          37
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Ephraimite clans numbered by their registered men: 32,500.",
          "These were Joseph’s descendants by their clans."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          38
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Benjamin’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Belaite clan from Bela;",
          "the Ashbelite clan from Ashbel;",
          "the Ahiramite clan from Ahiram;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          39
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Shuphamite clan from Shupham;",
          "the Huphamite clan from Hupham."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          40
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Bela’s descendants from Ard and Naaman:",
          "the Ardite clan from Ard;",
          "the Naamite clan from Naaman."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          41
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Benjaminite clans numbered by their registered men: 45,600."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          42
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were Dan’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Shuhamite clan from Shuham.",
          "These were the clans of Dan by their clans."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          43
        ],
        "lines": [
          "All the Shuhamite clans numbered by their registered men: 64,400."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          44
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Asher’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Imnite clan from Imnah;",
          "the Ishvite clan from Ishvi;",
          "the Beriite clan from Beriah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          45
        ],
        "lines": [
          "From Beriah’s descendants:",
          "the Heberite clan from Heber;",
          "the Malchielite clan from Malchiel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          46
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And the name of Asher’s daughter was Serah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          47
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Asherite clans numbered by their registered men: 53,400."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          48
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Naphtali’s descendants by their clans:",
          "the Jahzeelite clan from Jahzeel;",
          "the Gunite clan from Guni;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          49
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Jezerite clan from Jezer;",
          "the Shillemite clan from Shillem."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          50
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Naphtali clans numbered by their registered men: 45,400."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          51
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These registered Israelite men numbered 601,730."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          52
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord spoke to Moses,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          53
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“The land is to be divided among them as an inheritance based on the number of names."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          54
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Increase the inheritance for a large tribe and decrease it for a small one. Each is to be given its inheritance according to those who were registered in it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          55
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The land is to be divided by lot; they will receive an inheritance according to the names of their ancestral tribes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          56
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Each inheritance will be divided by lot among the larger and smaller tribes.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          57
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Levites registered by their clans:",
          "the Gershonite clan from Gershon;",
          "the Kohathite clan from Kohath;",
          "the Merarite clan from Merari."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          58
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the Levite family groups:",
          "the Libnite clan,",
          "the Hebronite clan,",
          "the Mahlite clan,",
          "the Mushite clan,",
          "and the Korahite clan.",
          "Kohath was the ancestor of Amram."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          59
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The name of Amram’s wife was Jochebed, a descendant of Levi, born to Levi in Egypt. She bore to Amram: Aaron, Moses, and their sister Miriam."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          60
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar were born to Aaron,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          61
        ],
        "lines": [
          "but Nadab and Abihu died when they presented unauthorized fire before the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          62
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Those registered were 23,000, every male one month old or more; they were not registered among the other Israelites, because no inheritance was given to them among the Israelites."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          63
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the ones registered by Moses and the priest Eleazar when they registered the Israelites on the plains of Moab by the Jordan across from Jericho."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          64
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But among them there was not one of those who had been registered by Moses and the priest Aaron when they registered the Israelites in the Wilderness of Sinai."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          65
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the Lord had said to them that they would all die in the wilderness. None of them was left except Caleb son of Jephunneh and Joshua son of Nun."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
